# Fallback durability for item types that were never crafted (so the server cannot learn the value from the game's own items).
# TAB separated: item type id (or * = every type not listed) | durability at quality 100.  Durability for another quality = base x quality / 100.
# The first line with * is the default.  PLACEHOLDER VALUE: adjust after checking a freshly crafted item in the database
#   (SELECT ObjectTypeID, Quality, CreatedDurability FROM items WHERE ObjectTypeID=<id> LIMIT 5;)
*	1000
